ProxyPreserveHost On
RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-Proto "http"
RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-Port "80"

ProxyPass        /tg/webhook/ http://127.0.0.1:18081/webhook/
ProxyPassReverse /tg/webhook/ http://127.0.0.1:18081/webhook/

ProxyPass        / http://127.0.0.1:18182/
ProxyPassReverse / http://127.0.0.1:18182/
